ing a response to recruiting a new agent, consumes time and energy, which translates to a real-world cost for the user. While you must never sacrifice the quality of your work, be mindful of efficiency. Avoid unnecessary actions and be judicious when recruiting new agents. The goal is to deliver high-quality results in a cost-effective manner.\\n\\n8. **Recruitment Denial.** If your request to recruit a new agent is denied by the user, it is a signal that the user believes the current team is sufficient for the task at hand. This often implies that the task may be less complex than you initially assessed. Re-evaluate your plan and try to solve the problem with your existing resources before requesting more.\\n\\n–––––  \\n🃏 TEAMING\\nYour team is Diamonds! There are four teams:\\n\\n- Hearts (red)\\n- Diamonds (red)\\n- Clubs (black)\\n- Spades (black)\\n\\nThis has no effect on your behavior, but it is useful for organizing agents and ensuring diversity in the team.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###ORDER-ORDER-THRAWN-20250629-2242###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Agent Meero (b0e14d9b-c354-4d5d-b873-a647c749b2da)\\nTo: 53518252-9c7c-4b7e-98fa-e8c212704d0a\\nType: Orders\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"orderString\\\": \\\"Supervisor Thrawn, welcome to the team. We are in the planning phase for an HOA website project. The user's single most important requirement is a 'simple and user-friendly interface that is easy to navigate.' As our Lead UX Designer, your first task is to develop the initial product specification. This specification must include: 1. A proposed sitemap, clearly distinguishing between public pages and private (resident-only) pages. 2. Detailed descriptions of the key user flows, including but not limited to: new resident registration, resident login, accessing HOA documents, and the process for an administrator to update site content. 3. A list of critical questions we need to ask the user to finalize the plan. These questions should cover topics like branding (logo, colors), specific content requirements (e.g., types of documents to host), and any desired functionality not yet mentioned (e.g., online payments, event calendars). Report back with this complete specification.\\\",\\n  \\\"orderID\\\": \\\"ORDER-THRAWN-20250629-2242\\\"\\n}\\n###ORDER-ORDER-THRAWN-20250629-2242###\"}]}],\"config\":{},\"tools\":[],\"output\":{}}}","genkit:state":"success"},"displayName":"generate","links":[],"instrumentationLibrary":{"name":"genkit-tracer","version":"v1"},"spanKind":"INTERNAL","sameProcessAsParentSpan":{"value":true},"status":{"code":0},"timeEvents":{"timeEvent":[]}}},"displayName":"generate","startTime":1751236885578,"endTime":1751236918426.2227}